error[E0320]: a borrowed pointer escapes its scope: the scope `r` would occur in the result `BorrowIO r (BorrowedPtr r CFile)`
  --> tests/achc/fail/compile/extern_escape.chs:19:37
   |
19 |   (f, h) <- withBorrowedIO f (\h -> return h)
   |                                     ^^^^^^^^
   = note: a borrowed C pointer (`BorrowedPtr`), or a function or computation using it (`BorrowIO`), cannot leave the `withBorrowed` / `withBorrowedIO` that lent it: the owner may free the pointer after
   = help: return a value read through the pointer instead
